+ *
+ *   __get_page_tail <- special_mapping_fault <- __do_fault <- handle_mm_fault
+ *                   <- get_user_pages <- process_vm_rw_core <- process_vm_readv
+ *   Kernel panic - not syncing: Fatal exception
+ *
+ * The only caller that matters here is Android's crash_dump, which reads a
